    <div class="eyebrow">Core Technology</div>
    <h2>Every robot teaches<br>;every other robot.</em></h2>
    <div class="fed-grid">
      <div class="fed-copy rev">
        <p>ARIA's core architectural innovation is a federated learning network across all deployed units. Each robot contributes <strong>anonymized behavioral improvements</strong> ;; not raw data ;; to a shared model. When one unit discovers a more effective approach to a task, that improvement propagates to other ARIA units on their next connection.</p>
        <p>This is built on <strong>federated averaging and differential privacy</strong> ;; established techniques from the machine learning research community, applied here to physical robot behavior. No raw operational data ever leaves the device.</p>
        <p>The network effect is central to ARIA's value proposition: <strong>the more robots run ARIA, the smarter every robot becomes.</strong> Units that operate offline receive model updates when they next connect.</p>
